  1845                              <1> ;  The imports: kernel32.dll only. An import directory entry, the import
  1846                              <1> ;  lookup table, the hint/name entries and the DLL's name; then the import
  1847                              <1> ;  address table, which the loader fills in, right below `next`, so that
  1848                              <1> ;  CALL [EBP+d8] reaches it.
