  1986                              <1> rawend:
  1987                              <1> RAWSIZE equ     (rawend-tstart+1FFh) & ~1FFh
  1988 00000CD4 00<rep 12Ch>        <1>         times   (-(rawend-tstart)) & 1FFh db 0
