  1990                              <1> ; ---- the interpreter's variables, after the code (zero at the start) -------
  1991                              <1> ; They are in the zeros that pad the section to its FileAlignment, or past
  1992                              <1> ; them in the uninitialised part: within 127 bytes of `next` either way.
  1993                              <1>         absolute rawend
