  2000 00000CFC ??                  <1> v_iscon:resb    1               ; non-zero if the input is a console
  2001 00000CFD ??                  <1> v_pcnt: resb    1               ; the break key's countdown
  2002 00000CFE ????????            <1> v_mode: resd    1               ; the console's input mode at the start
  2003 00000D02 ????????            <1> v_npend:resd    1               ; the heap's first address (checked '_')
  2004 00000D06 ????????            <1> v_skat: resd    1               ; where the skip started (checked N)
  2005 00000D0A ????????            <1> v_edln: resd    1               ; the editor: the line ^E put in the input
